# Conecsa kiosk: weston is skipped at boot when no display is connected (see
# the ExecCondition in weston.service.d/10-conecsa-kiosk.conf). A DRM hotplug
# event asks systemd to start it; the condition runs again, so an unplug event
# or a still-disconnected connector changes nothing.
ACTION=="change", SUBSYSTEM=="drm", ENV{HOTPLUG}=="1", TAG+="systemd", ENV{SYSTEMD_WANTS}+="weston.service"
